#: ../../library/time.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`time` --- time related functions"
msgstr ":mod:`time` --- 时间相关函数"

#: ../../library/time.rst:7
msgid ""
"The ``time`` module provides functions for getting the current time and "
"date, measuring time intervals, and for delays."
msgstr "``time`` 模块提供了用于获取当前时间和日期、测量时间间隔以及延时的函数。"

#: ../../library/time.rst:10
msgid ""
"**Time Epoch**: The Alif- and i.MX RT-based OpenMV Cams use the POSIX epoch "
"of 1970-01-01 00:00:00 UTC. The STM32-based OpenMV Cams use an epoch of "
"2000-01-01 00:00:00 UTC. The epoch year can be determined at runtime with "
"``gmtime(0)[0]``."
msgstr ""
"**时间纪元**\\ ：基于 Alif 和 i.MX RT 的 OpenMV Cam 使用 POSIX 纪元 1970-01-01 00:00:00 "
"UTC。基于 STM32 的 OpenMV Cam 使用纪元 2000-01-01 00:00:00 UTC。可在运行时通过 "
"``gmtime(0)[0]`` 确定纪元年份。"

#: ../../library/time.rst:15
